OL,3,ARussian strikes cut power to thousands
OL,4,Ain Ukraine as Kherson ceasefire to end
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare humanitarian ceasefire in
OL,7,FUkraine's Kherson region, that has
OL,8,Fallowed civilians to evacuate the
OL,9,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky, is
OL,10,Fdue to end on Sunday night.
OL,12,FWhile the localised ceasefire on the
OL,13,Ffront line has held since it was
OL,14,Fimplemented last week, fighting has
OL,15,Fcontinued elsewhere.
OL,17,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,18,Fsaid Russia had struck energy
OL,19,Finfrastructure in four regions
OL,20,Fovernight on Saturday, leaving hundreds
OL,21,Fof thousands of homes without power.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
