OL,3,ARussian strikes cut power to thousands
OL,4,Ain Ukraine as Kherson ceasefire to end
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother overnight strike killed two
OL,7,Fpeople, including a 13-year-old girl,
OL,8,Fin the Vinnytsia region, the State
OL,9,FEmergency Service of Ukraine said.
